  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wave Accelerator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to safe water and sanitation remains low in Ethiopia. This is largely attributed to low private sector development in the Ethiopian WASH sector. By supporting high-potential WASH ventures in Ethiopia with a comprehensive business development service, Wave Accelerator (WASH Ventures Accelerator) program aims to revolutionize the Ethiopian WASH sector. Through this program, iceaddis will accelerate the ventures in the program to launch and scale their WASH products and services more sustainably and grow their operations in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
